# Makeshift Binding: the ability exiles "target creature an opponent controls" (CR 601.2c): Bot1's own Phyrexian Walker is refused. Bot2
# has a Memnite and an Ornithopter; Bot1 targets the Memnite and, with the ability on the stack, Lightning Bolts it (Mox Ruby). The target is
# illegal on resolution, so the whole ability is countered (CR 608.2b): Bot1 gains no life (20), the Ornithopter is still there, the Binding
# stays on the battlefield and the Memnite is in Bot2's graveyard.

